1
00:00:00,550 --> 00:00:03,350
Lampu merah yang kedip-kedip di meteran listrikmu itu...

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:04,840
lagi ngitung uangmu.

3
00:00:05,780 --> 00:00:09,560
Tiap alat punya watt, tanda seberapa rakus dia makan listrik.

4
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:13,060
Lampu 10 watt, rice cooker 400.

5
00:00:13,770 --> 00:00:15,870
kWh itu watt dikali jam.

6
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:19,180
1.000 watt nyala sejam, itu 1 kWh.

7
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:23,170
Di dalam meteran, ada chip yang ngukur tegangan dan arus

8
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:26,100
ribuan kali tiap detik, lalu dikali jadi watt.

9
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:28,990
Terus dijumlahkan, jadi kWh.

10
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:30,670
Itu yang motong tokenmu.

11
00:00:31,470 --> 00:00:32,610
Nah, kedipan tadi?

12
00:00:33,120 --> 00:00:34,860
1 kedip = 1 watt-jam.

13
00:00:35,130 --> 00:00:36,970
1.000 kedip = 1 kWh.

14
00:00:37,750 --> 00:00:39,830
Kedip cepat bukan berarti meteran rusak.

15
00:00:40,090 --> 00:00:42,260
Artinya pemakaianmu lagi besar.

16
00:00:42,930 --> 00:00:44,890
Meteran lama pakai piringan berputar.

17
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:46,820
Makin kencang, makin boros.

18
00:00:47,210 --> 00:00:49,970
1 kWh sekitar Rp1.400-an.

19
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:52,020
Jadi, matikan yang nggak dipakai.

20
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:54,420
Follow buat fakta rumah berikutnya!
